    "passage": "Woman: I got a pickup message for my order. I need the lamp tonight, but I’ve lost the order number.\nMan: We can search by the order’s phone number. To collect anything, show photo ID matching the name on the order.\nWoman: That’s my number, but the order is in my brother’s name. Are my lamp and notebook both ready?\nMan: The lamp is here. The notebook arrives tomorrow. We text for each item and hold it through Saturday.",
    "passageZh": "女：我收到了訂單的取貨通知。今晚需要桌燈，但我找不到訂單編號。\n男：可以用訂單留下的電話號碼查詢。取貨時須出示與訂單姓名相符的附照證件。\n女：電話是我的，但訂單是我哥哥的名字。桌燈和筆記本都能取了嗎？\n男：桌燈到了。筆記本明天到。我們會對每件商品分別發簡訊，並保留到星期六。",
    "audioScript": "I got a pickup message for my order. I need the lamp tonight, but I’ve lost the order number.\nWe can search by the order’s phone number. To collect anything, show photo ID matching the name on the order.\nThat’s my number, but the order is in my brother’s name. Are my lamp and notebook both ready?\nThe lamp is here. The notebook arrives tomorrow. We text for each item and hold it through Saturday.",
