      "prompt": "Why might finding the order still not let her collect it?",
      "promptZh": "就算查得到訂單，為什麼她可能仍不能取貨？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Her phone number can find it, but her ID name may not match the order.",
          "zh": "她的電話能查到訂單，但她的證件姓名可能與訂單不符。",
          "whyZh": "查詢可用電話，但取貨要核對姓名；電話是她的，訂單卻在哥哥名下。"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "The shop can search only by confirmation number.",
          "zh": "店家只能用確認編號查詢。",
          "whyZh": "店員明確說可以用訂單上的電話查詢。"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Having the phone number means both items must be released together.",
          "zh": "提供電話後就必須兩件一起領。",
          "whyZh": "電話只用來查單，不改變逐件領取的規則。"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "The shop holds only orders paid for by phone.",
          "zh": "店家只保留用電話付款的訂單。",
          "whyZh": "對話沒有用電話付款這個條件。"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanationZh": "查詢可用電話，但取貨要核對姓名；電話是她的，訂單卻在哥哥名下。",
      "evidence": "We can search by the order’s phone number. To collect anything, show photo ID matching the name on the order. | That’s my number, but the order is in my brother’s name. Are my lamp and notebook both ready?",
      "vocabulary": [
        {
